---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
import AuditClose from "../components/AuditClose.astro";
---

<Site
  page="about"
  title="About Anchorline | Conviction, Intelligence & Execution"
  description="Anchorline Systems LLC is led by founder and CEO Kris McFadden. Learn about the convictions and operating principles behind the Anchorline AI Growth Engine."
>
  <section class="container page-hero about-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ANCHORLINE SYSTEMS</p><h1>
      Built to connect<br />what growth<br /><span class="accent-word"
        >depends on.</span>
    </h1><div class="about-intro">
      <p class="large-copy">
        Anchorline Systems exists to turn intelligence, digital capability, and
        coordinated execution into a more connected customer-acquisition system.
      </p><p>
        We build and operate the Anchorline AI Growth Engine for established
        B2B, service, and local businesses. The configuration changes with the
        market. The commitment to clear priorities and accountable work does
        not.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section founder-section">
    <div class="container editorial-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">FOUNDER & LEADERSHIP</p><div
          class="founder-monogram"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <span>KM</span><i></i>
        </div>
      </div><div class="editorial-copy">
        <h2>Kris McFadden</h2><p class="mono founder-role">
          FOUNDER & CEO / ANCHORLINE SYSTEMS LLC
        </p><p class="large-copy">
          A founder-led company with a clear point of accountability.
        </p><p>
          Kris leads Anchorline’s direction and operating standards. The Growth
          Engine brings research, acquisition, digital execution, and follow-up
          into a shared framework rather than treating them as disconnected
          services.
        </p><p>
          Our credibility should come from the work we can explain, the outputs
          we can show, and the results we can substantiate—not inflated claims.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section container">
    <p class="eyebrow">OPERATING PRINCIPLES</p><h2>
      How we approach the work.
    </h2><div class="principles-ledger">
      <article>
        <span class="mono">01</span><h3>Inspect before acting.</h3><p>
          Understand the business, existing infrastructure, and intended
          conversion before recommending a change.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span class="mono">02</span><h3>Connect the system.</h3><p>
          Choose capabilities for their contribution to the acquisition motion,
          not as isolated line items.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span class="mono">03</span><h3>Make responsibility clear.</h3><p>
          Define scope, ownership, review, and the next action. AI capability
          does not replace human judgment.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span class="mono">04</span><h3>Show the evidence.</h3><p>
          Separate observations from assumptions and illustrative work from
          verified client outcomes.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section foundation-section" id="foundation">
    <div class="container foundation-composition">
      <p class="eyebrow">OUR FOUNDATION</p><div>
        <blockquote>
          “Because He is, we are—and everything we build reflects that reality.”
        </blockquote><p>
          Anchorline’s convictions shape how we serve, lead, and build.
          Technology, rightly ordered, should support purposeful work,
          responsible stewardship, and operational excellence.
        </p><p>
          That foundation is expressed through accountable decisions, honest
          claims, and care for the people and organizations our work affects.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section container editorial-split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">OUR OWN OPERATING FRAMEWORK</p><h2>
        Intelligence and execution<br />need shared context.
      </h2>
    </div><div class="editorial-copy">
      <p class="large-copy">
        2ndBrainOS is Anchorline’s proprietary operating framework supporting
        intelligence, automation, knowledge, and execution.
      </p><p>
        It helps connect context and execution behind the Growth Engine, so
        research, decisions, and action can support the same client objective.
      </p><a href="/growth-engine/" class="text-link"
        >See what the Growth Engine enables <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span
        ></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <AuditClose />
</Site>
